{
  "id": "bg-uchilishchni-vakantsii",
  "name": "Български училищни ваканции — многоезичен (OpenHolidays editorial)",
  "title": "Български училищни ваканции — многоезичен (OpenHolidays editorial)",
  "description": "Bulgarian school-vacation calendar sourced from the openpotato/openholidaysapi.data editorial seed used by the OpenHolidays API. Covers the standard Bulgarian school-year vacation stems — Коледна ваканция (Christmas), Междусрочна ваканция (Winter/mid-term), Пролетна ваканция (Spring), Великденска ваканция (Easter), Лятна ваканция (Summer) — for school years from 2019/2020 through 2026/2027. Each record carries the OpenHolidays UUID, start/end date pair, computed duration in days, three-language names (BG/DE/EN), and a multi-language Comment field where the upstream notes grade-level scope (e.g., \"BG VII-XI клас,DE Klassen 7-11,EN Grade 7-11\"). RegionalScope is National for the entire BG slice (Bulgaria has no per-oblast school-vacation split). First bg-uchilishchni-* dataset in the project — fully additive to the existing BG bucket. Native Bulgarian Cyrillic preserved verbatim via ensure_ascii=False.",
